# The image takes only pyproject.toml and uv.lock, the package's readme and licence (README.md, LICENSE), llm_mini_infer/
# and deploy/ (deploy/Dockerfile); everything else stays out of the build context: secrets, private data, models,
# results, environments.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!llm_mini_infer/
!deploy/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
